    {
      "id": "02_aether_tour",
      "title": "以太群岛：从世界需求出发的 AI 协作设计",
      "label": "空岛地形环顾",
      "start": 47.43333333333333,
      "duration": 47.2,
      "preview": "modules/02_aether_tour/preview.zh.mp4",
      "voice_timing": [
        {
          "paragraph": 1,
          "text": "来到以太群岛，先说说我们的设计理念。这里的地形会给创造提出问题：怎么跨过空隙，怎么运送物资，怎么让机器替玩家完成重复劳动？我们希望玩家带着目标去设计，再回到世界里验证。",
          "source": "modules/02_aether_tour/audio/zh/6df944db617bff1677f5.wav",
          "sha256": "32e4b1a9c8b560e927c3a6039a6076e67a72a03d923fa2e6824b84dfe14c428a",
          "start": 0.2,
          "duration": 14.08,
          "raw_duration": 12.800041666666667,
          "tempo": 0.9090938683712121
        },
        {
          "paragraph": 2,
          "text": "在这里，人工智能更像一位设计搭档。你用自然语言说明外观、结构和行为，它可以协助搭建载具，编写控制程序；也可以设计会跟随、巡逻的无人机，或者能和玩家互动的机器人玩家。生成只是起点，工具栏让你继续修改、测试，把结果真正变成自己的作品。",
          "source": "modules/02_aether_tour/audio/zh/d462466d218364e45918.wav",
          "sha256": "db50e3ed8ae0165d6477b946c5b2b740ba0f7582039ea60ea9516d5c1e0f06fa",
          "start": 14.53,
          "duration": 18.92,
          "raw_duration": 17.11,
          "tempo": 0.9043340380549681
        },
        {
          "paragraph": 3,
          "text": "我们还想把这种协作扩展到自动化建造。比如让智能体指挥铺路机器人，观察前方地形，一边移动一边修路。载具、机器人和世界因此形成联系：你提出目标，AI 帮你实现，再用实际运行来检验设计。",
          "source": "modules/02_aether_tour/audio/zh/4daf0344c76562cb4f42.wav",
          "sha256": "8aadf358c9c1f582f0d4d3ba1a193b25f3362abea7e49a485568ae8bb0c403ee",
          "start": 33.7,
          "duration": 13.120041666666667,
          "raw_duration": 14.93,
          "tempo": 1.1379537031449976
        }
      ],
      "clips": [
        {
          "source": "footage/replacements/02-aether-full-ring.mp4",
          "in": 2.1,
          "out": 49.300000000000004,
          "duration": 47.2,
          "mode": "realtime"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "03_toolbar",
      "title": "创作者工具箱：核心玩法与微体素工作流",
      "label": "工具栏设计与用法",
      "start": 94.63333333333333,
      "duration": 39.93333333333333,
      "preview": "modules/03_toolbar/preview.zh.mp4",
      "voice_timing": [
        {
          "paragraph": 1,
          "text": "先看底部工具栏。选择器负责框选空间，锤子用来放置物品，扳手可以抓取、旋转和配置活动实体。铁锹编辑一米见方的标准方块，勺子则用于更细的微体素，每格只有十二点五厘米。",
          "source": "modules/03_toolbar/audio/zh/a96df3a9acb9ccb2c522.wav",
          "sha256": "19343890fe7cc52652ad5236e91de613195710bdf10782c93b006c9457dc5d75",
          "start": 0.2,
          "duration": 15.83,
          "raw_duration": 14.4,
          "tempo": 0.9096651926721415
        },
        {
          "paragraph": 2,
          "text": "画笔（Brush）负责改变颜色与材质，而建模工具（Modeling）则可以添加精致的视觉装饰构件。数字键 1 到 7 随时切换工具，下方选项也会随当前操作智能切换，简单又直观。",
          "source": "modules/03_toolbar/audio/zh/41b09f3ffff25304aff9.wav",
          "sha256": "65bfd921743cb0aac7f957e92a740b51920d94c0b185fc8d89c50b522971366b",
          "start": 16.279999999999998,
          "duration": 12.24,
          "raw_duration": 12.54,
          "tempo": 1.0245098039215685
        },
        {
          "paragraph": 3,
          "text": "这套工具箱确保了游戏绝不会沦为被动的 AI 盲盒——AI 赋予大结构，而你永远拥有最直观、可预期的方式来检查、修复并打上专属的个性化烙印。",
          "source": "modules/03_toolbar/audio/zh/0fd907d90e1aa1977093.wav",
          "sha256": "210b8f76973f6fd35767f80d5b6b427155296fda604e7997782c4b04d6d9b8a6",
          "start": 28.769999999999996,
          "duration": 10.8,
          "raw_duration": 10.0,
          "tempo": 0.9259259259259258
        }
      ],
      "clips": [
        {
          "source": "footage/03-toolbar-clean.mp4",
          "in": 0.0,
          "out": 12.6,
          "duration": 16.279999999999998,
          "mode": "fit"
        },
        {
          "source": "footage/03-toolbar-clean.mp4",
          "in": 12.6,
          "out": 24.0,
          "duration": 12.489999999999998,
          "mode": "fit"
        },
        {
          "source": "footage/03-toolbar-clean.mp4",
          "in": 24.0,
          "out": 34.0,
          "duration": 11.163333333333334,
          "mode": "fit"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "04_agent",
      "title": "连接 Agent Build：AI 协同建造系统",
      "label": "Agent Build 授权与工作流",
      "start": 134.56666666666666,
      "duration": 30.1,
      "preview": "modules/04_agent/preview.zh.mp4",
      "voice_timing": [
        {
          "paragraph": 1,
          "text": "这就是 Space 的核心系统：Agent Build。只需打开面板，把提示词复制给你常用的外部 AI Agent，它就能通过开放接口，直接连入当前的体素世界。",
          "source": "modules/04_agent/audio/zh/4a5bd8b239a7046be132.wav",
          "sha256": "99df20764fae359d78237ec2ddbf28d0675359f36e87f3b18d7212b61e604b67",
          "start": 0.2,
          "duration": 11.36,
          "raw_duration": 11.44,
          "tempo": 1.0070422535211268
        },
        {
          "paragraph": 2,
          "text": "无论是主流大模型还是本地 Agent，连接后它就是你的全能建造副驾。它负责理解你的日常自然语言，在几秒内算出三维结构、铺设方块并自动写好底层的控制程序。",
          "source": "modules/04_agent/audio/zh/4af2927f1ef856474a85.wav",
          "sha256": "2107f074379b5189627c479a1bfe47771bfc6bc4788cd55204389c5d178155ab",
          "start": 11.809999999999999,
          "duration": 11.91,
          "raw_duration": 12.56,
          "tempo": 1.054575986565911
        },
        {
          "paragraph": 3,
          "text": "一套连接可以在所有世界中无缝复用，省心又高效。现在，让我们进入第一个实机实装演示！",
          "source": "modules/04_agent/audio/zh/e6761f0cdeec18ab02c2.wav",
          "sha256": "33fbadf9d3097b09556ab1138201db92226cc1f0ce88610a0c6db42dce336b0d",
          "start": 23.97,
          "duration": 5.76,
          "raw_duration": 6.64,
          "tempo": 1.1527777777777777
        }
      ],
      "clips": [
        {
          "source": "footage/reused/04-agent.mp4",
          "in": 0.0,
          "out": 30.1,
          "duration": 30.1,
          "mode": "fit"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "05_chinook_prompt",
      "title": "实战演示：自然语言生成双旋翼直升机",
      "label": "支奴干构建请求",
      "start": 164.66666666666666,
      "duration": 32.43333333333333,
      "preview": "modules/05_chinook_prompt/preview.zh.mp4",
      "voice_timing": [
        {
          "paragraph": 1,
          "text": "在以太群岛，我们需要一架能够跨越空岛的重型空中载具——支奴干纵列双旋翼运输直升机。在 Space 中与 AI 交互非常直观，一段精准的提示词通常涵盖外观、功能结构与操作方式：",
          "source": "modules/05_chinook_prompt/audio/zh/bdb109c54cdb80346b95.wav",
          "sha256": "5d46821e8900eadf6d5e88f55758fc01ac53e42774f5cfd6b095c15b1e60b260",
          "start": 0.2,
          "duration": 12.11,
          "raw_duration": 13.53,
          "tempo": 1.1172584640792733
        },
        {
          "paragraph": 2,
          "text": "请建造一架橄榄绿的运输直升机，包含清晰的座舱、中空的可进入机舱、起落轮和可用的驾驶位。两组旋翼独立旋转，方向相反，通过推力和姿态力矩实现飞行。W 和 S 控制俯仰，A 和 D 控制转向，空格和 Shift 控制升降。",
          "source": "modules/05_chinook_prompt/audio/zh/9bc79d5670c469c06860.wav",
          "sha256": "09831e1378dc1d1a0042d9adc8b2f62bc881f8f5d7bf085c03bb13f234deafac",
          "start": 12.559999999999999,
          "duration": 19.5,
          "raw_duration": 16.91,
          "tempo": 0.8671794871794872
        }
      ],
      "clips": [
        {
          "source": "stills/05-chinook-prompt.png",
          "in": 0.0,
          "out": 32.43333333333333,
          "duration": 32.43333333333333,
          "mode": "realtime"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "06_chinook_inspect",
      "title": "载具结构解析：多组件与自动控制",
      "label": "支奴干模型检查",
      "start": 197.1,
      "duration": 35.3,
      "preview": "modules/06_chinook_inspect/preview.zh.mp4",
      "voice_timing": [
        {
          "paragraph": 1,
          "text": "生成瞬间完成。可以看到，机身与前后两组旋翼都是独立的活动实体组件。",
          "source": "modules/06_chinook_inspect/audio/zh/1df269d4c0a19119931e.wav",
          "sha256": "aba3222603d78c5267b3f43a81bd1cd89e54504d2dd0d45a00f44821950a8518",
          "start": 0.2,
          "duration": 6.24,
          "raw_duration": 5.28,
          "tempo": 0.8461538461538461
        },
        {
          "paragraph": 2,
          "text": "驾驶位也值得单独看一眼。在 Space 里，它不只是机舱中的装饰坐垫，而是带有登机逻辑和输入映射的交互定义，负责把玩家的操作交给飞行器。",
          "source": "modules/06_chinook_inspect/audio/zh/d48a4cbe56000ca84cc6.wav",
          "sha256": "870e37193040f9ca4280000da832b0b1310233314c12dacb164b5b920c8046b1",
          "start": 6.69,
          "duration": 9.12,
          "raw_duration": 10.08,
          "tempo": 1.105263157894737
        },
        {
          "paragraph": 3,
          "text": "绕机身观察，双旋翼间距舒展合理，起落架提供了充裕的离地间隙。最关键的是，整套飞行控制器完全由 Agent 一键生成并编译完成——从双旋翼的反向转矩对冲到自稳悬停算法，复杂的后台代码全部自动搞定，让玩家无需任何编程门槛，直接享受飞行的乐趣。",
          "source": "modules/06_chinook_inspect/audio/zh/e82fc11efeb26398e795.wav",
          "sha256": "bdd6ee49c83cb1cacb0db9004c7fb9f14d633bc64d97b5125a296a24e82be1fc",
          "start": 16.06,
          "duration": 18.86,
          "raw_duration": 18.95,
          "tempo": 1.0047720042417816
        }
      ],
      "clips": [
        {
          "source": "footage/06-chinook-inspect-clean.mp4",
          "in": 0.0,
          "out": 35.0,
          "duration": 35.3,
          "mode": "fit"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "07_chinook_refine",
      "title": "细节雕琢：用微体素与画笔定制外观",
      "label": "勺子与画笔修补",
      "start": 232.39999999999998,
      "duration": 29.9,
      "preview": "modules/07_chinook_refine/preview.zh.mp4",
      "voice_timing": [
        {
          "paragraph": 1,
          "text": "接下来，我们看看生成以后怎样亲手微调。切换到第一人称，暂时停用实体，开始编辑。",
          "source": "modules/07_chinook_refine/audio/zh/e3f003aaad8ee8872419.wav",
          "sha256": "97e882dd22396044db2f039c7f5284f5fc47cbfd09e64f93ad864a7b3380fb9d",
          "start": 0.2,
          "duration": 6.76,
          "raw_duration": 6.78,
          "tempo": 1.002958579881657
        },
        {
          "paragraph": 2,
          "text": "拿出勺子工具，对准八分之一米的微体素。沿着机身边缘削出一道小缺口，不用移除整块标准方块，就能像雕刻一样精细地修饰外形。",
          "source": "modules/07_chinook_refine/audio/zh/6a0b39c2681bb1b19cb4.wav",
          "sha256": "97bdff0c5e61feebf754553ab8e2236607ec48f3870d3725ca325a53aa86f2d1",
          "start": 7.21,
          "duration": 10.24,
          "raw_duration": 10.0,
          "tempo": 0.9765625
        },
        {
          "paragraph": 3,
          "text": "随后换上画笔（Brush），挑选亮眼的辅色为机体喷绘个性化标识。这就是 Space 的创作魅力：AI 快速帮你完成繁重的基础搭建，而你只需花几秒钟，就能赋予它专属于你的视觉细节。",
          "source": "modules/07_chinook_refine/audio/zh/b677af6169a3676da7a5.wav",
          "sha256": "fff9045bba5c3c65151577d885e6c55e08aa5aacd85d2ba5d34823a7a67f35a8",
          "start": 17.7,
          "duration": 11.84,
