    {
      "id": "09_chinook_flight_a",
      "title": "首飞体验：动力手感与大半径巡航",
      "label": "支奴干起飞",
      "start": 300.66666666666663,
      "duration": 32.7,
      "preview": "modules/09_chinook_flight_a/preview.zh.mp4",
      "voice_timing": [
        {
          "paragraph": 1,
          "text": "增加升力，直升机从草坪平稳垂直起飞！接下来，轻轻按下前进键，机头自然下俯，推力带着我们向前飞行。",
          "source": "modules/09_chinook_flight_a/audio/zh/0371fe19bf2d7e1a6363.wav",
          "sha256": "b496484ed69f63098706dbf77c6d3e0f0935427b17629069b49ab10c942e53ef",
          "start": 0.2,
          "duration": 7.91,
          "raw_duration": 8.04,
          "tempo": 1.016434892541087
        },
        {
          "paragraph": 2,
          "text": "松开按键，飞机自动减速，重新进入稳定悬停。第一个弯我们转得宽一些，让这架重型运输机保留应有的重量和惯性，操控起来沉稳而不急躁。",
          "source": "modules/09_chinook_flight_a/audio/zh/43ddd745977b0fbb594c.wav",
          "sha256": "fdee084e2eaf0667ad6305427df1f721e694a1a8d7674a737c689a14eb698a1b",
          "start": 8.36,
          "duration": 11.84,
          "raw_duration": 10.59,
          "tempo": 0.8944256756756757
        },
        {
          "paragraph": 3,
          "text": "转过身来，城堡退向身后，阳光穿透天空中的巨环，在云海中勾勒出壮丽的轮廓。逐一测试单项控制，能帮助你在第一时间轻松摸透飞机的操控特性。",
          "source": "modules/09_chinook_flight_a/audio/zh/7cb11882a2f3f15b84cc.wav",
          "sha256": "c2a3232a89e7864e877e824ebb55c75dbb201458802bbf640153f546903e96af",
          "start": 20.45,
          "duration": 11.87,
          "raw_duration": 10.4,
          "tempo": 0.8761583824768324
        }
      ],
