    {
      "id": "10_chinook_flight_b",
      "title": "航线探索：跨越空岛的飞行自由",
      "label": "支奴干环绕飞行",
      "start": 333.3666666666666,
      "duration": 39.9,
      "preview": "modules/10_chinook_flight_b/preview.zh.mp4",
      "voice_timing": [
        {
          "paragraph": 1,
          "text": "切到第三人称，我们从浮岛上空飞过。直升机和远处地形的轮廓清晰，即使没有小地图，也能判断彼此的位置和航向。",
          "source": "modules/10_chinook_flight_b/audio/zh/6959fb0cea22cbdc3bec.wav",
          "sha256": "7c2b7e3d797f7ac06649fa9b7921a03184b9ca9cb04c74ddeb946945b14c6abe",
          "start": 0.2,
          "duration": 8.48,
          "raw_duration": 8.08,
          "tempo": 0.9528301886792453
        },
        {
          "paragraph": 2,
          "text": "在侧倾转弯和俯仰巡航中，整台飞行器表现出极其平顺的自稳质感——松开按键就能稳稳泊在半空，这正是 Agent 智能算法带来的省心体验。",
          "source": "modules/10_chinook_flight_b/audio/zh/c9072fe55bc30dfd3ce0.wav",
          "sha256": "20451f8c0233abf1b97c477c5a70e140fcb7417bbc43cbe0cfc2089ef28920e3",
          "start": 8.93,
          "duration": 11.71,
          "raw_duration": 10.76,
          "tempo": 0.9188727583262168
        },
        {
          "paragraph": 3,
          "text": "这时候，这架支奴干真正激活了以太群岛的玩法：原本不可逾越的虚空鸿沟，变成了自由翱翔的天空舞台，远方的孤岛随时都能降落探索。",
          "source": "modules/10_chinook_flight_b/audio/zh/02dff8a29ad745fd5577.wav",
          "sha256": "c1666852051e8c16347744f6385e9382903cb5d924ad155b3f1997162d12ebd5",
          "start": 20.89,
          "duration": 8.72,
          "raw_duration": 10.64,
          "tempo": 1.2201834862385321
        },
        {
          "paragraph": 4,
          "text": "飞行时，远处地形和巨大的世界环始终连贯，展示了无缝加载的效果。空中试飞告一段落，接下来去第二座世界体验越野驾驶！",
          "source": "modules/10_chinook_flight_b/audio/zh/80f14c54dd83636a67c8.wav",
          "sha256": "ac877ca30b05329f969f11d1f572aad26114e8f46b8422e9a94d7198fa86840a",
          "start": 29.86,
          "duration": 9.69,
          "raw_duration": 8.79,
          "tempo": 0.9071207430340557
        }
      ],
